	(text "Pins 1-4 + 9 follow PMOD Type 7 (LRCLK, DAC data in, ADC data out, BCLK, MCLK)\nfor the RT1010 TX clocks. RX bus clocks on 7/8, aux SAI1 data line on 10.\nArty HS pairs: 1-2, 3-4, 7-8, 9-10 (MCLK paired with the quiet aux line)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 248.92 0)
		(effects
