		(uuid "a01afe8b-965e-5486-80ce-b49c9e2de751")
	)
	(text "Series terminations at the buffer outputs.\nY0 -> RT1010 SAI1_MCLK (GPIO_08)\nY1 -> RT1010 GPT2_CLK (GPIO_AD_03), async feedback\nY2 -> FPGA via PMOD JB9"
